ong>","</strong>"]},{"s":40468,"e":40525,"k":"block","t":"Remove a custom theme (built-in themes cannot be deleted)","f":[]},{"s":40578,"e":40668,"k":"block","t":"Theme optionsKTPH000","f":["<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#theme-options\" title=\"Permanent link\">&para;</a>"]},{"s":40699,"e":40706,"k":"block","t":"Setting","f":[]},{"s":40716,"e":40720,"k":"block","t":"Type","f":[]},{"s":40730,"e":40737,"k":"block","t":"Default","f":[]},{"s":40747,"e":40756,"k":"block","t":"Stored as","f":[]},{"s":40794,"e":40859,"k":"block","t":"When enabled, applying a theme also changes font family and size.","f":[]},{"s":40869,"e":40875,"k":"block","t":"toggle","f":[]},{"s":40885,"e":40888,"k":"block","t":"Off","f":[]},{"s":40898,"e":40926,"k":"block","t":"KTPH000","f":["<code>applyThemeFonts</code>"]},{"s":41014,"e":41018,"k":"block","t":"Note","f":[]},{"s":41026,"e":41220,"k":"block","t":"When this option is enabled, selecting a theme from the Colors tab's color profile dropdown will also apply that theme's font family and size. When disabled, only the theme's colors are applied.","f":[]},{"s":41267,"e":41382,"k":"block","t":"Built-in vs. custom themesKTPH000","f":["<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#built-in-vs-custom-themes\" title=\"Permanent link\">&para;</a>"]},{"s":41391,"e":41687,"k":"block","t":"korTTY includes a set of built-in color themes (e.g., Default, Dark Mode, Solarized Light). Built-in and custom themes are stored together in a single file, KTPH000. All themes appear in the Colors tab's color profile selector and in connection-specific theme dropdowns.","f":["<code>~/.kortty/themes.xml</code>"]},{"s":41753,"e":41760,"k":"block","t":"Warning","f":[]},{"s":41768,"e":41887,"k":"block","t":"Built-in themes cannot be edited or deleted. To modify a built-in theme, duplicate it first, then edit the custom copy.","f":[]},{"s":41922,"e":42012,"k":"block","t":"Theme previewKTPH000","f":["<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#theme-preview\" title=\"Permanent link\">&para;</a>"]},{"s":42021,"e":42247,"k":"block","t":"A live theme preview displays the theme's colors. The preview shows six swatches — foreground, background and cursor, plus the AI agent panel's background, run and error colors — so you can evaluate a theme before applying it.","f":[]},{"s":42283,"e":42389,"k":"block","t":"Cross-tab integrationKTPH000","f":["<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#cross-tab-integration\" title=\"Permanent link\">&para;</a>"]},{"s":42404,"e":42568,"k":"block","t":"KTPH000Colors tabKTPH001: Choose a theme via the \"Color Profile\" dropdown; if the Themes tab's font option is enabled, the selected theme's font is also applied.","f":["<strong>","</strong>"]},{"s":42578,"e":42759,"k":"block","t":"KTPH000Connection settingsKTPH001: Each individual SSH connection can override the global font and theme via its own settings (accessible in Connection Manager or Quick Connect).","f":["<strong>","</strong>"]},{"s":42769,"e":42970,"k":"block","t":"KTPH000Terminal emulationKTPH001: Font and theme colors affect only the terminal content; the application UI style (menu bar, dialogs, tabs) is determined by the Appearance tab's app design setting.","f":["<strong>","</strong>"]},{"s":43855,"e":43870,"k":"text","t":"\n  Back to top\n","f":[]},{"s":44113,"e":44154,"k":"text","t":"MIT-licensed · Developed by Daniel Mengel","f":[]},{"s":44200,"e":44212,"k":"text","t":"\n    korTTY ","f":[]},{"s":44220,"e":44226,"k":"text","t":"v2.8.0","f":[]}]}